      "claim": "The L1 reference contexts report F ≥20% for smaller, less lipophilic molecules (e.g., acalabrutinib 25.3%, AZD0837 22–55%, maraviroc 33%, asciminib ~73%), but their transferability to the query is limited by the query's much larger size (MW 738.9), higher TPSA (174.6), and higher logP (6.22).",
